    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7a8096ac671b1fb3c8843ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“好歌剧”。\n她是言行如歌剧王般的自恋狂，\n乍看之下是个搞笑的赛马娘──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3fdcb167600b49c35dbbfe49cb2a7a8e3e3712e65f2d3061d0585874ae94223",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
